WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.555
Effective detection engineering combines technical knowledge, operational awareness, collaboration, and humility.

2
00:00:06.555 --> 00:00:14.248
Teams should remain curious, test assumptions, seek feedback, document decisions, and improve practices over time.

3
00:00:14.248 --> 00:00:17.172
A healthy culture treats detections as living products.

4
00:00:17.172 --> 00:00:22.141
They have users, dependencies, maintenance needs, and quality expectations.

5
00:00:22.141 --> 00:00:26.940
This mindset helps teams build detections that analysts can understand and trust.

6
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.914
Sustainable capability requires shared ownership.

7
00:00:29.914 --> 00:00:41.857
Security engineers, SIEM administrators, analysts, hunters, responders, infrastructure teams, application owners, and managers all contribute different context that improves detection work.

8
00:00:41.857 --> 00:00:43.873
The objective is not perfection.

9
00:00:43.873 --> 00:00:54.928
The objective is creating a durable capability that helps defenders identify, investigate, and respond to suspicious activity efficiently while adapting as the organization changes.
